 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "The tree is given as a list of rows [value, childValues] in preorder: the first row is the root and each node's children are listed in order. Values are unique. compressedNodes lists values to compress; values not in the tree and the root are ignored, and repeats do not matter. Compressing a node removes it and puts its children, in order, where it stood in its parent's child list; this applies recursively, so a compressed child of a compressed node is replaced by its own children. Return the resulting tree in the same preorder row format.",
  "provenance": [
